# Atelier — API Reference (llms.txt)

> Machine-consumable index. Deep detail: `atelier` skill package; runtime queries via MCP (`registry.*`, `tokens.list`, `state.*`).

## Core primitives (atelier/runtime)

| API | Signature | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `<?>` state | `$state<T>(init) → Signal<T>` | `signal.value` read/write; write triggers microtask-batched update |
| derive | `$derived<T>(fn) → Signal<T>` | lazy cache; read-only (ATR-305 on write) |
| effect | `$effect(fn) → cleanup` | subscribes to deps read inside fn |
| component | `component(fn, { name, schema }) → ComponentDef` | fn returns `html\`...\`.locals({...})` |
| html | `html\`...\`` (tagged template) | `.locals(obj)` injects scope (compiler captures later) |
| stream | `streamValue<T>() → { values, value, done, error, push, finish }` | streaming text/values; error frames never close the stream; no manual setInterval |
| optimistic | `optimisticList<T>() → { values, rollbacked, revertErrors, optimisticAdd, commit, revert }` | pending → committed / rollback (revert errors carried in `revertErrors`) |
| store | `store.commit/rollback/timeTravel/list` | named checkpoints; app-state only (source = git, decision 15) |
| graph | `store.graph(keyOf?)` | live dependency graph (signals + effect edges); keyOf remaps ids |
| log | `store.log(n)` | $state mutation journal (seq/at/sig/from/to, bounded ring) |
| validate | `validateFlat(schema, data)` → `{ ok, error?: AtrError }` | flat schema (no $ref/oneOf); leaf constraints min/max/pattern |

## Template DSL

`{expr}`（对象/数组字面量 `{{a: x.value}}`、`{a}` 简写）· `{#if}{:else if}{:else}{/if}` · `{#each arr as item, idx [by key]}` · `on:click={handler}（.prevent/.stop 修饰符：on:click.prevent={handler}，ATR-326 白名单外拒绝）` · `bind:value={sig}` / `bind:checked={sig}` / `bind:group={sig}`（表单双向，目标=可写 $state；$derived→ATR-305 / 目标非法或组合越面→ATR-324 / 同槽重复冲突→ATR-325 / radio 缺 value 身份键→ATR-327；bind:group × radio，组身份=静态 value 属性，组内互斥经信号）· `attr={expr}`（含对象字面量）· void 元素 `<br>/<img>/<input>` — 解析期显式拒绝未闭合/错位结构（ATR-101）。

## Contract (flat schema)

```json
{ "type": "object", "reqProps": { "name": { "type": "string" } },
  "optProps": { "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["running", "done"] } } }
```
Rules: pure data, literal discriminants, no generics, no $ref/oneOf.

## CLI

| Command | Flags |
|---|---|
| `atelier init --target <dir> --name <Name> [--no-ai]` | agent layer (AGENTS.md/llms.txt/specs/client MCP configs) on by default; `--no-ai` opts out |
| `atelier dev [--prod-db <path>]` | dev face + MCP + server-face supervisor |
| `atelier review [--open]` | needs a running dev server |
| `atelier check` / `atelier test` | check = eight-layer struct gate; test forwards to the app runner |
| `atelier snapshot save \| check [--update] [--full]` | never auto-promotes; human review first |
| `atelier api-diff snapshot \| check` | public API surface drift gate |
| `atelier checkpoint save \| list \| rollback` | decision-15 source checkpoints (save = gated anchor) |
| `atelier build --target=node\|bun [--out <dir>]` | self-hosted single-container artifact (D-F14) |
| `atelier compile / gen db\|endpoint\|auth / migrate / db backup / impact / call / export openapi / mcp / skills` | generator family, reversible migrations, online backup, impact navigation, endpoint CLI calls, OpenAPI export, MCP server, skill installer/gate |
| `atelier e2e` / `atelier lint` / `atelier package` | STUB (exit 4, honest) — spec positions, not runnable yet |

## Errors

`{ code, message, context, fix }` — domains: 1xx compile / 2xx contract / 3xx runtime / 4xx MCP. Table: `skills/atelier-error-codes/SKILL.md` (read `fix` and execute).

## Design tokens

`atelier.config.json → tokens` is the only source; `--color-primary` etc.; missing token = ATR-204.

## Packages

Framework repo today: `atelier/` (runtime/server/compiler/gen/dev/mcp/skills self-contained). npm release split (`@atelier/compiler` · `@atelier/eslint` · `@atelier/review` · `create-atelier`) is planned, not implemented (decision 13a/14).
